---
---
<section id="how" class="how bg-grid">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">How</p>
    <h2>Three actions. One human gate.</h2>
    <p class="lede">
      Every entry passes through the same loop. You stay in control — nothing publishes without your sign-off.
    </p>

    <ol class="steps">
      <li class="step">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Paste a URL</h3>
          <p>Tutorial, paper, repo, video, dataset. Plain URL, no account required to start.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Tag it</h3>
          <p>Pick from existing tags or add the one that is missing. Discoverability is a first-class move.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="step">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <div>
          <h3>Review</h3>
          <p>An LLM reads the content and suggests a summary, tag, and a confidence. You confirm, edit, or throw it out. Rank follows use, not votes.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .how {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .how .lede { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .step {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--card);
  }
  .step-num {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--magenta);
    line-height: 1;
    align-self: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .step { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.75rem; }
  }
</style>
